{
  "schema": "chunks.invariant-controls.v1",
  "note": "Each control breaks one named safety invariant in a copy of the source and expects at least one of the listed JVM tests to FAIL. A control that survives is a witness gap, not a pass. Run locally with tools/invariant_controls.py; never commit a mutated file. A control with known_gap is expected to SURVIVE until its witness exists.",
